 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, the wedding Wi-Fi was awful.",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 2.04,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Full bars,",
   "s": 2.1,
   "e": 2.72,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "nothing loaded.",
   "s": 2.78,
   "e": 3.77,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bars show how loud",
   "s": 4.02,
   "e": 5.06,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the router is.",
   "s": 5.12,
   "e": 6,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not how busy.",
   "s": 6.06,
   "e": 7.09,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Busy with what?",
   "s": 7.28,
   "e": 8.39,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wi-Fi is one room,",
   "s": 8.54,
   "e": 10.21,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "one speaker.",
   "s": 10.32,
   "e": 11.35,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only one device talks",
   "s": 11.7,
   "e": 12.88,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "at a time.",
   "s": 12.94,
   "e": 13.86,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "One? There were two hundred phones.",
   "s": 13.92,
   "e": 16.13,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "They take turns.",
   "s": 16.3,
   "e": 17.24,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each listens first.",
   "s": 17.3,
   "e": 18.57,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "If it's quiet,",
   "s": 18.76,
   "e": 19.58,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "it talks.",
   "s": 19.64,
   "e": 20.45,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And if two talk together?",
   "s": 20.62,
   "e": 21.99,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Crash. Both stop,",
   "s": 22.24,
   "e": 23.78,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "wait a random moment,",
   "s": 23.84,
   "e": 24.72,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "try again.",
   "s": 24.78,
   "e": 25.59,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Why random?",
   "s": 25.9,
   "e": 26.83,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Same wait,",
   "s": 27.08,
   "e": 27.84,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "same crash. Forever.",
   "s": 27.9,
   "e": 29.41,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So more phones,",
   "s": 29.72,
   "e": 30.78,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "more crashes?",
   "s": 30.84,
   "e": 31.69,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "More crashes,",
   "s": 31.84,
   "e": 32.66,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "more waiting.",
   "s": 32.72,
   "e": 33.48,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone's turn gets thinner.",
   "s": 33.54,
   "e": 35.11,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. So one old",
   "s": 35.3,
   "e": 36.4,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "phone slows everyone?",
   "s": 36.46,
   "e": 37.95,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A slow phone needs longer",
   "s": 38.3,
   "e": 39.78,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "to say the same thing.",
   "s": 39.84,
   "e": 41.17,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone waits for it.",
   "s": 41.4,
   "e": 42.95,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the neighbor's Wi-Fi?",
   "s": 43.16,
   "e": 44.49,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Same room.",
   "s": 44.72,
   "e": 45.71,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The old band has",
   "s": 46,
   "e": 46.86,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "three clear channels.",
   "s": 46.92,
   "e": 48.37,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The street shares them.",
   "s": 48.66,
   "e": 49.94,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "How do I fix it?",
   "s": 50,
   "e": 51.07,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The fast band,",
   "s": 51.18,
   "e": 51.86,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "or a cable.",
   "s": 51.92,
   "e": 53.11,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A cable gets its own room.",
   "s": 53.4,
   "e": 55.22,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So who was the slow",
   "s": 55.28,
   "e": 56.24,
   "line": 19,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "phone at the wedding?",
   "s": 56.3,
   "e": 57.41,
   "line": 19,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mine. Thirty minutes to send one",
   "s": 57.98,
   "e": 60.32,
   "line": 20,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "photo of the cake.",
   "s": 60.38,
   "e": 61.63,
   "line": 20,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
